# Lists and Modifiers Corpus Test

This document tests various list styles, modifiers, and block features.

---

## Numbered Lists

### Single Level (Decimal)

@1 First item
@2 Second item
@3 Third item

### Multi-Level Nesting

@1 Parent item one
@@a Alpha sub-item
@@b Another alpha sub-item
@@@i Roman numeral sub-sub-item
@@@ii Second roman sub-sub-item
@@c Third alpha sub-item
@2 Parent item two
@@a Sub-item under two

### Different Numbering Styles

@1 Decimal one
@2 Decimal two

@a Alpha lower a
@b Alpha lower b

@A Alpha upper A
@B Alpha upper B

@i Roman lower i
@ii Roman lower ii

@I Roman upper I
@II Roman upper II

### Decimal Sub-Numbering

@1 First top-level
@@1.1 Sub-item one point one
@@1.2 Sub-item one point two
@@@1.2.1 Deep nested item
@2 Second top-level
@@2.1 Sub-item two point one

### Nested Content Under List Items

@1 Item with nested content
  This paragraph is nested under item 1.
  It continues on multiple lines.

  Another paragraph under item 1.

@2 Item two with **bold** and *italic* inline

---

## Bullet Lists

### Single Level Bullets

@- First bullet point
@- Second bullet point
@- Third bullet point

### Multi-Level Bullet Nesting

@- Top-level bullet
@@- Nested bullet level 2
@@@- Nested bullet level 3
@@- Back to level 2
@- Another top-level

### Mixed Content in Bullets

@- Bullet with plain text
@- Bullet with **bold** and *italic*
@- Bullet with [a link](https://example.com)

---

## Alignment Modifiers

### Center Alignment

@center This paragraph is centered.

@center
  This is a multi-line
  centered block of text.

### Right Alignment

@right This text is right-aligned.

@right
  Multi-line right-aligned
  content here.

---

## Indentation Modifiers

### Basic Indent

@indent This text is indented.

### Indent with Count

@indent:2 This text is indented by 2 levels.

@indent:3
  Multi-line content
  indented by 3 levels.

### Indent with Length

@indent=0.5in This text is indented by half an inch.

@indent=36pt
  Content indented by 36 points.

### Outdent

@outdent This text has decreased indentation.

@outdent:2 This text has indentation decreased by 2.

---

## Text Style Modifiers

### Bold Modifier

@bold This entire line is bold.

@bold
  This multi-line block
  is all bold text.

### Italic Modifier

@italic This entire line is italic.

@italic
  This multi-line block
  is all italic text.

### Small Caps Modifier

@small This text uses small caps.

### All Caps Modifier

@caps This text is in all capitals.

---

## Heading Style Modifiers

@h1 Heading Level 1

@h2 Heading Level 2

@h3 Heading Level 3

@h4 Heading Level 4

@h5 Heading Level 5

@h6 Heading Level 6

---

## Box Modifier

@box
  This content is inside a box.
  It has a border around it.

@box Important notice text.

@box
  **NOTICE:** This is a formatted box.

  With multiple paragraphs inside.

---

## Blockquotes

> This is a simple blockquote.

> This is a multi-line blockquote.
> It continues on the next line.
> And another line.

> Outer blockquote level.
>> Nested blockquote inside.
>>> Deeply nested blockquote.
>> Back to second level.
> Back to first level.

> Blockquote with **bold** and *italic* text.

