## Combined Features

### Lists with Modifiers

@center
  @1 Centered list item one
  @2 Centered list item two

@bold
  @- Bold bullet one
  @- Bold bullet two

### Modifiers Nested in Lists

@1 First item
  @box
    Content in a box under item 1.

@2 Second item
  @center Centered content under item 2.

### Blockquotes with Formatting

> This blockquote contains **bold** text.
> And also *italic* text.

### Complex Nesting

@box
  ## Heading Inside Box

  @1 List inside box
  @@a Nested inside box
  
  > Blockquote inside box.

---

End of corpus test.
